window.products.push({"id":750052,"name":"The BOCE Coaster, 2 Pack - Taste Enhancing Drink Coaster, Make Your Beverage Go from Good to Great - Enhance The Taste of Your Drink in 3 Minutes - Wo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915B5SRavEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The BOĆE Taste Enhancing Drink Coaster - A revolutionary way to enhance the taste of any drink. Place your glass on the coaster and enjoy a smoother, cleaner and tastier beverage. Ideal for wine and liquor. Includes 2 reusable coasters. From Good To Great - In just 3 minutes on the BOĆE Coaster, your drink will become noticeably smoother, tastier and more enjoyable. Use at home, or at the bar! Take the BOĆE Challenge with us and prepare to be blown away. Works On All Beverages - These drink coasters improve the taste and flavor of all drinks, but the most noticeable changes are with wine and harsh alcohols (vodka, whisky, tequila etc). Also use it with your daily water, coffee, smoothie and tea. How Does The BOĆE Coaster Work? - Proprietary, patent-pending, taste enhancing frequencies are emitted from the coaster and infused into beverages. Frequencies can travel through solid barriers such as a glass, cup or mug. How Long Does It Take? - Your drink is ready in just 3 minutes, and it gets better the longer you leave it on the coaster. Backed by science, independent lab studies show a reduction of fusel oils and oxidation along with an increase in aeration resulting in a smoother tasting experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915B5SRavEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOCE","source_asin":"B0BCL1G4CX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCL1G4CX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCL1G4CX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
