window.products.push({"id":750104,"name":"Reusable Glass Straw, 12 Pack Glass Straws Shatter Resistant, 8.5\" x 0.4\" Set of 6 Straight 6 Bent Colorful Eco-Friendly Straw 4 Brush, Perfect for Sm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716G-LJcquL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"SET OF 12 PIECES GLASS STRAWS - This kit includes 6 straight straws, 6 curved straws, and 4 cleaning brushes. The reusable straws have length of 8.5\" (21.5 centimeters) and diameter of 0.4\" (1 centimeter). The longer size allows the product to be used in more containers and the 0.4\"diameter allows for a more enjoyable drink. Our straws are a perfect replacement for plastic straws. PREMIUM GLASS STRAWS - We use BPA-free borosilicate glass to make our glass pipe whose operating temperatures are from -40C° to +200C°. Borosilicate has exceptional durability and is more shatterproof than other glasses. The colors remain brilliant after each use and washing. In addition, borosilicate is microwave, oven, freezer, and dishwasher safe! REUSABLE AND ENVIRONMENT FRIENDLY - The reusable straw is in safe keeping and can be reused, to avoid the non-degradable garbage brought by the plastic straw, not to affect the ecological balance. Glass straws reusable have a higher level of protection for our health and living environment. In addition, according to research on traditional plastic straws, exposure to high temperatures may increase the incidence of cancer. Since the glass straw, there is no problem at all. EASY TO CLEAN - Easy to clean in a dishwasher or with the built-in 4 straw brushes that can easily penetrate the entire wall of the clear straw. The straws are ideal for cold and hot beverages such as smoothies, lemonades, milkshakes, water, coffee, hot/iced tea, milk, cocktails, hot chocolate, and juices. SAFETY TIPS: Please be aware that these straws are made of borosilicate glass. It can still break if dropped on the floor or somewhere. If straws break, please clean them immediately and keep them away from children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716G-LJcquL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Roniatic","source_asin":"B0B96KKKY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B96KKKY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B96KKKY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
