window.products.push({"id":750106,"name":"Yarlilyan 7 Sheets Unicorn Kids Nail Sticker for Little Girls Women, DIY Pink Beautiful Nail Art Decals Artist Painting Polish Self Adhesive Nail Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713OEDkvHqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size: 2.4''x3.6'' / 6x9cm. Package Included: 7 pieces Unicorn Kids Nail Sticker in package as picture. Note: Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item. How to use: 1.Clean the nail and select the suitable sticker.Tear off. 2.Align the curved edge of the nail sticker with side of the fingernail. 3.Push the nail sticker from the inside radically out to the edge and scrape it. 4.Remove the needless nail sticker along with the edge of the fingernail. 5.Paint seal coat. 6.The nail art is done!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713OEDkvHqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yarlilyan","source_asin":"B09Z5Q2YF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z5Q2YF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z5Q2YF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
