window.products.push({"id":750127,"name":"Harry Kritz Red Rose Flower Printed Set of 4 Cloth Napkins 18 by 18 inch 100% Cotton Designer Washable Reusable Dinner and Dining Napkins for Everyday","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KZeRHRZnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRAND: A brand born out of a passion for textiles, technology and design. Our march towards the goal was arduous but short owing to the richness of our experience, the invaluable and immensely creative pool of talent at our behest and the unwavering focus on the ever-changing trends combined with our relentless endeavor to evolve a new benchmark for the home textile industry. Framed with a sprinkling of delicate water color strokes, our products celebrate the natural beauty of all seasons. The cotton is woven in twill weave, for us on antique looms, and the latest print technology equipped with neo pigment ink which endows the fabric with fine details of the skilful water color artist. The elegant drape and soft lustre become richer with time and use. Our products meet the highest sustainability standards with nearly zero wastewater and a low carbon footprint, enabling printing that fits eco friendliness. COLLECTION A Red, Red Rose Celebrate the magic of the season with these colorful cotton kitchen linen collections with designs taking inspiration from the poem “A Red Red Rose” by the legendary poet Robert Burns. To the poet, his love is like a red red rose, his love so deep and everlasting which would survive till all the seas dry up. The products, much like the poem, appear simple yet both are the unaffected effusion of the creative mind. The products, for sure, would also carry one to heights of luxury and grandeur promising optimum quality combined with eco- friendly design and technique. Emphasizing the absolute redness, a red, red rose, the collection demonstrates art as a sign of sincerity leading to absolute purity. The products are curated with meticulous care and designed with hand painted water color prints.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KZeRHRZnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Harry Kritz","source_asin":"B07RCZHYZ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RCZHYZ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RCZHYZ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
