window.products.push({"id":750129,"name":"Mediterranean Terrace II by Vivian Flasch | Woven Tapestry Wall Art Hanging | Italian Villa Seaside Coastal Theme | 100% Cotton USA Size 54x41","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":170.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dJ2vnayxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wall Tapestries can be fun and still make a statement in your home. Our Tapestries are a must have piece of wall art decor as they always become a conversation piece. The texture of the wall tapestry makes this art unique and creates the intrigue that captivates us to examine it more closely. This art wall hanging is woven in our family owned textile mill in the mountains of North Carolina by expert weavers who have generations of weaving experience. We select the highest quality cotton yarn, weave it on jacquard looms then we cut and sew each wall tapestry by hand.  The fabric of the tapestry creates an acoustic elegance to any room unlike the printed sheet \"tapestries\" which poorly imitate an authentic woven wall tapestry. The back of the tapestry is open so you can see how craftsmanship and weave structure creates the image on the face of the art. We use natural fibers such as cotton for each and every wall tapestry. Cotton is the most comforting natural fiber and it invites the touch of a hand...when was the last time you touched a painting. A wall tapestry is an inviting addition to your home decor. Our family was America’s first weavers, weaving blankets for our troops during the revolutionary war in our mill in Philadelphia.  We love what we do and are proud of our textile heritage. From our family to yours we make sure you are receiving a wall tapestry that will last a lifetime. Enjoy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dJ2vnayxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fine Art Tapestries","source_asin":"B004I0IRQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004I0IRQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004I0IRQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
