window.products.push({"id":750245,"name":"Aivanart Christmas Decorations Pillow Covers Indoor, Farmhouse Christmas Gnome Deocrative Buffalo Plaid Throw Pillow Covers 18x18 Set of 4 for Couch H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XgzVMoFeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Included: Each package includes 4pcs 18x18 inches (45 x 45 cm) Christmas gnome pillow covers，no inserts or fillers. There may be a deviation of 1-2cm because of hand-cutting and sewing. With these exquisite farmhouse decorative couch cushion covers, you can easily and quickly change the holiday decorations of the room. Stylish Pillowcases: These rustic holiday throw pillow covers are printed with different Christmas-themed patterns, such as Christmas gnomes, Christmas trees, snowflakes and the words \"let it snow\" and \"merry christmas\". Only one side is printed and the other side is blank. It is a perfect addition to farmhouse Christmas decor, decorating the room with them will definitely add a lot of festive atmosphere. Gnome Christmas Decorations: In folklore, gnomes are responsible for protecting the family from misfortune, and they are regarded as symbols of good luck. Gnomes have become an indispensable part of Christmas decor. Add these cute Christmas throw pillow covers to your home, share the stories of the gnomes with your family, and spend an unforgettable and happy Christmas together! Excellent Workmanship: Our Christmas indoor pillow cases are made of superium materials, breathable, strong and durable, lasting for years. Classic red and black plaid pattern is clear and vivid and does not fade easily. Hidden zipper closure design makes these farmhouse cushion cases more elegant and will not scratch your skin or hook clothes. Wide Application：These eye-catching decorative couch pillow covers are suitable as a decoration for Christmas and New Year. You can put them in the bedroom, living room, chair, sofa, bed, and dress up anywhere you want. These rustic pillowcases are easy to mix and match with other winter holiday decorations and bring texture and color into the room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XgzVMoFeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aivanart","source_asin":"B09C62DZDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C62DZDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C62DZDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
