window.products.push({"id":750251,"name":"Mozaic Futon Mattress, Full, Navy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uOEhYx4hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Item in image is our Ivory color option View larger Color Options Mozaic Full Size 10-Inch Futon/ Platform Mattress, Navy This cotton futon mattress comes in many colors, so you can choose the style that suits your home. The foam mattress is soft, making it a great resting place for guests in your home. The fabric is lace tufted onto the mattress, which gives the futon a 'sofa-like' appearance. The comfortable design can easily fold for sofa or bed positions. Frame not included. Construction Materials The futon mattress is constructed of foam wrapped in a mix cotton blend. It is then encased in a durable poly-cotton blend cover. It is lace tufted through for a clean, finished look. Versatility This is a perfect mattress for futon frames and platform bed frames. The frame is not included. You'll sleep easy each night on this comfy platform futon mattress. It is ideal for small apartments and dorm rooms. Care Instructions It ships in a vacuum packed bagging inside a box. Please allow several days for the mattress to return to its full loft and for the wrinkles in the cotton cover to smooth out. You've put a lot of care into choosing your furnishings and with continued care you should be able to enjoy them for many years to come. We recommend dusting with a soft dry cloth. Do not use abrasive cleaners. Do not leave spills unattended. Protect from heat and liquids. Keep out of direct sunlight to prevent fading. Spot clean with water. Details and Dimensions: Color options: Ivory, khaki, black, navy, red, blue, hunter green, and burgundy Color options: Ivory, khaki, black, navy, red, blue, hunter green, and burgundy 75-inch by 54-inch by 10-inch thick 75-inch by 54-inch by 10-inch thick Cotton wrapped foam Cotton wrapped foam Reversible for extended wear Reversible for extended wear Lace-tufting for a sofa like appearance Lace-tufting for a sofa like appearance Materials: Poly-Cotton fabric, convoluted foam, cotton blended fiber Materials: Poly-Cotton fabric, convoluted foam, cotton blended fiber Upholstery: Poly-cotton Blend Upholstery: Poly-cotton Blend Fill materials: Cotton blended fiber, foam Fill materials: Cotton blended fiber, foam Care Instructions: Spot clean with cold water Care Instructions: Spot clean with cold water Constructed with different combinations of cotton blended fiber and foam Constructed with different combinations of cotton blended fiber and foam Can be used on a full size futon frame or a platform bed (not included) Can be used on a full size futon frame or a platform bed (not included) Frame not included Frame not included Cover is not removable Cover is not removable Amazon.com Mozaic Full Size 10-Inch Futon Mattress, Navy This 10-inch navy futon mattress is constructed of cotton wrapped foam with a durable cotton cover. It is lace tufted with taupe thread. The futon mattress is completely reversible. It ships vacuum packed bagged inside a box. Please allow several days for the mattress to return to its full loft and for the wrinkles in the cotton cover to smooth out. The frame is not included. Features: Size: 75-inch by 54-inch by 10-inch thick Size: 75-inch by 54-inch by 10-inch thick Made of egg crate foam wrapped in layers of cotton fiber Made of egg crate foam wrapped in layers of cotton fiber Covered in durable cotton fabric Covered in durable cotton fabric Tufted in taupe thread Tufted in taupe thread Completely reversible Completely reversible Vacuum packed, allow several days for mattress to expand to its complete size Vacuum packed, allow several days for mattress to expand to its complete size Warranty covers any manufacturer imperfections or flaws that were caused during manufacturing processes only Warranty covers any manufacturer imperfections or flaws that were caused during manufacturing processes only Warranty does not cover normal wear and tear Warranty does not cover normal wear and tear Frame not included Frame not included Made in the USA Made in the USA This Mozaic full size 10-inch futon mattress ships in one carton.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uOEhYx4hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mozaic","source_asin":"B005QGZ508","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005QGZ508","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005QGZ508","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
