window.products.push({"id":750271,"name":"Doug & Cristy Designs Square Metal Legs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZleP2jECL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"These Handcrafted heavy duty modern table legs are available in raw steel and are perfect for DIY residential and commercial tables or coffee tables. LISTING IS PRICED FOR SET OF 2 legs. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS Product Style: Square Metal Legs Dimensions: 1/4” thick x 19” wide x 16 1/2” high Material: raw steel Finish: Raw unfinished steel Includes flat head screws and wall anchors for complete shelf installation. MFG Origin: Texas, U.S.A. OUR PROCESS We professionally handcraft all of our metal products you see listed. We start with American made steel, then use our tooling and machinery to bend the metal to create our own custom designs. We remove all sharp corners, and inspect 100% to ensure item consistency. HANDLING AND CARE INSTRUCTIONS We only use new, high quality American made steel for the production of our leg brackets. Raw, uncoated steel may contain surface variations including color, texture, pitting, flaking, minor scratches, mill scale, oxidation, etc. Eventually raw, uncoated steel will oxidize. The rate at which this occurs is highly dependent on ambient humidity levels. In humid summer months, minor surface oxidation may even occur during transit, but can be easily removed by using a Scotch Brite pad or steel wool. In order to mitigate future oxidation, many of our customers choose a natural solution such as linseed oil (flax seed) or beeswax as both have been used for centuries as metal protectants. Additional options include bowling alley wax or liquid paint/clear coat such as Rustoleum Clear Coat, or of course your favorite color. \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZleP2jECL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Doug and Cristy Designs","source_asin":"B07QVMY9D3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QVMY9D3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QVMY9D3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
