window.products.push({"id":750302,"name":"Rada Cutlery Curved Paring Knife Stainless Steel Blade With Aluminum Made in USA, 6-1/8 Inch, Silver handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AtGr9jOcL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"The Rada Cutlery R100 Granny Paring Knife will be one of the most utilized knives you have in your repertoire. The curved blade makes it easy to peel and core tomatoes, dice up fruits, devein shrimp, remove the skin from potatoes and much more. It is the perfect knife for so many intricate kitchen tasks. The blade measures 2-3/8 inches and has an overall length of 6-1/8 inches. It features a surgical grade, T420 high carbon stainless steel curved blade that is hand sharpened creating a razor sharp edge. The hollow ground blade ensures a precision concave surface for maximum edge retention. The permanently cast, solid brushed aluminum handle on the granny paring knife is designed to be not only visually appealing, but for performance too. There is also a finger guard for maximum protection while cutting. This knife has to be hand-washed. It cannot be washed or dried in the dishwasher. Rada Mfg. Co. is located in Waverly, Iowa and has been manufacturing cutlery in the USA since 1948. Our mission is all about “providing our customers the best value of kitchen knives for their dollar.” We stand by our craftsmanship. Rada Mfg. Co. will replace any product manufactured by our company returned to us due to defects in material or workmanship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AtGr9jOcL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RADA","source_asin":"B000G00YOG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750302","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000G00YOG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000G00YOG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":750303,"name":"Takeya Actives Insulated Stainless Tumbler with Flip Lid, 20oz, Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612kQFsxGqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRING THE HEAT, KEEP YOUR COOL. Takeya Actives 20oz Insulated Stainless Steel Tumblers keep your favorite drink ice cold or steaming hot for hours. Featuring the ULTIMATE FLIP LID - our patented, leak-proof, Flip Lid seals closed to end spills. So you can shake, toss, or tip your Tumbler without losing a drop. Great for pre and post workout drinks, the Flip Lid ensures you can bring your drinks on the go. Our convenient Hinge-Lock keeps the tab away from your face for a comfortable drinking experience, and the wide, easy-flow opening also accommodates a straw. The clear 100% BPA-free Tritan lid is dishwasher safe and shatterproof. Crafted from food grade 18/8 stainless steel, the BPA-free Insulated Tumblers feature a sweat-free double-wall design and protective silicone bumper to allow for a quiet set-down and secure, rattle-free fit in most cupholders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612kQFsxGqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Takeya","source_asin":"B073RLFV1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073RLFV1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073RLFV1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
