window.products.push({"id":750316,"name":"HOMI CHEF 9.5\" Mirror Polished Stainless Steel Nonstick Omelette Pan/Frying Pan (Non Toxic PFOA FREE Nonstick Coating) NICKEL FREE Stainless Steel non","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gEyzB5YML._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"MIRROR POLISHED & DURABLE NONSTICK COATING - This 9.5\" stainless steel nonstick pan is noble & elegant: polished exterior has a gleaming, mirror-like finish; black interior works well with a black bakelite handle, cutting a fine figure in the kitchen - Durable PFOA-free nonstick coating allows you to cook with minimal oil, ensures effortless food release and makes cleanup a breeze - Perfect for panfrying eggs, flipping pancakes, turning sausages, searing steaks, or browning & frying foods. ESPECIALLY ENGINEERED SAFE & ADVANCED NONSTICK COATING - TEFLON nonstick coatings, free of PFOA (a potentially toxic chemical that causes people's concern), alleviate harmful effects to the environment or to you - Engineered by HOMI CHEF to resist chipping, peeling, flaking, and other kinds of abrasions for safety & durability, lasting seven times longer than ceramic coatings - 500F is the recommended maximum for cooking, enough for everyday cooking temperatures & safe for normal home cooking. IDEAL FOR NICKEL FREE & HEALTHY & CONVENIENT COOKING - Our food grade NICKEL FREE stainless steel (Cr/Ni: 18/0) won't leach nickel into food, which is a priority toxin - The PFOA-FREE nonstick coating does not react with foods & allows minimal-oil searing & frying - Convenient use: no more need to spend much time stirring or turning foods; Easy clean: the nonstick surface resists scratches & stains, making cleanup a breeze - Great for either a beginning cook or a more experienced chef. ADDITIONAL FEATURES - 5MM thick 3-Ply construction in the base (one layer of pure aluminum core sandwiched between two stainless steel layers) ensures optimal thermal distribution and storage, thus faster cooking, better nutrition, and more energy savings - Rivetless handle ensures easier cooking and less interference from rivet heads, eliminating food and bacteria collection areas - Flared rims facilitate easy lifting and flipping - Compatible with gas, induction, ceramic and halogen cooktops.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gEyzB5YML._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMICHEF","source_asin":"B074P3PXG1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074P3PXG1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074P3PXG1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
