window.products.push({"id":750338,"name":"Yourtablecloth Heavy Duty Clear Vinyl Round Fitted Tablecloth (Table Cover) Elasticized Tablecloth Great for Protecting Your fine Tables and Table Lin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xWI6IDfnL._AC_SL1077_.jpg","description":"NO ACCIDENTAL DISPLACEMENTS – Let notorious children play at the table without worrying about them accidentally pulling or displacing the tablecloth, which could otherwise damage your expensive cutlery and also result in an embarrassing situation, in addition to the unwanted mess. Our heavy duty clear fitted vinyl tablecloths come with elastic edges, firmly fit your table, and offer a frustration free dining experience. NEGLIGIBLE MAINTENANCE – Wipe it clean just by swiping a damp cloth – no washing or ironing after every use, or similar other complicated maintenance needs. It makes your life easier and serves its intended purpose efficiently. Let children spill drinks, drop morsels or food crumbles at home yet have the table cleaned just in a blink, let customers wait no more than a few seconds before you clean the mess caused by previous customer, and let yourself be more comfortable. HEAVY DUTY PERFORMANCE – With 6 gauge thickness for high durability, elasticized for non-slip grip, our clear fitted tablecloth effectively PROTECTS your table against scratches, moisture, dust, dirt and other adverse conditions. Neatly done edges also ensure high durability and long life. ELEGANCE & CLASS – Give a professional appeal to your space or add vibrance to outside dining or commercial spaces – Our wipeable tablecloth or elastic tablecloth is ideal for hotels, restaurants, cafes, patios, home, canteens, and other catering facilities. Available in many sizes to let you choose the best match for your table, interior or space. 100% RISK-FREE SATISFACTION GUARANTEE – We also offer you 100% Risk-Free Satisfaction Guarantee to let you buy with confidence; no questions asked. However, we are quite sure that you will be super impressed with the incredible protection offered by this clear vinyl tablecloth, easy to put on design, firm fitness and durable build.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xWI6IDfnL._AC_SL1077_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yourtablecloth","source_asin":"B075Z8FSHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075Z8FSHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075Z8FSHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":750339,"name":"KESS InHouse Empire Ruhl\"Spacey Houndstooth Heart\" Artistic Apron, 31 by 35.75\", Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J-zjEy2gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cook up a storm with artistic flare and protect your clothes with these KESS InHouse aprons! Made of durable, machine washable poly-canvas, these aprons measure 31 x 35.75 inches and will cover you from all kitchen mishaps. Stain resistant, these bold and colorful aprons are great for outdoor grilling, BBQs, baking and all culinary creations. Also great for clean up ranging from the kitchen table all the way up to household chores, as well as from home improvement projects such as painting and staining. Ties in the back for easy wear, and show off your flare for the bold and unique. At KESS InHouse, we see home decor as a chance to add art to the home and to bring together a collaborative community of artists. Whether it's on the couch, in the kitchen or hanging from a wall, we believe that art enriches our lives and we want to support the artists who make it possible. For this reason, a percentage of every KESS InHouse sale goes back to the artist who created the design. KESS InHouse curates every piece of artwork specifically keeping in mind the product line. We pride ourselves on the quality and integrity of our company and home decor line. KESS InHouse believes artists should be rewarded for their creativity, imagination, and ability to transform a blank surface into something remarkable. We would like to invite you to join us in our fight against blank walls and creatively lacking homes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J-zjEy2gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KESS InHouse","source_asin":"B00ZXFDE82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZXFDE82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZXFDE82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
