window.products.push({"id":750363,"name":"Memory Foam and Innerspring Hybrid Mattress, 14 Inch Double-Sided Cal-King Size Mattress with 2 Bonus Pillows, Flippable Mattress with Breathable Soft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zbjyhNxjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[14 Inch Mattress Construction] - Combines the traditional support of pocketed springs with the plush comfort of memory foam, merging the positive qualities of two mattress construction technologies into a single bed. The memory foam snugly reacts to your body shape providing contoured support, greatly improving your sleeping quality, and relieving the pressure; while the pocketed springs give you proper support and help to reduce motion. [Sleep On Both Sides] - With the flippable design of the mattress, you can comfortably sleep on either side. This can help extend the lifespan of the mattress by avoiding continuous wear and tear on the same sections of the bed, offering the benefit of durability while also providing the ability to easily adjust the feel of the bed. WARM TIPS: This 14-inch two-sided mattress comes with two Free pillows! [Luxury Sleep For You] - To further implement exceptional design and functionality into the mattress, we used a Fiberglass-Free FR inner cover to replace traditional materials that contain fiberglass to make sure you sleep more at ease; In addition, we used a breathable soft fabric cover that is removable via a zip at the bottom of the mattress, this enables effortless cleaning, keep your mattress fresher and increase mattress life. More, all our mattresses are CertiPUR-US certified. [Choose Your Level of Comfort] - On a firmness scale of 1 to 10, with 1 being the softest and 10 being the most firm. This memory foam mattress comes in three firmness types to suit your preference for feeling better and sleeping better. Type one: Medium (5) and Medium (5); Type two: Firm (8) and Firm (8); Type three: Medium (5) and Firm (7). Ideal for side, back, and stomach sleepers. Choose the right type, you can sleep comfortably on either side. [Smartly Shipped & Fit All Bed Frames] - Every mattress comes conveniently compressed and packed in a box. Delivered right to your door for easy setup. Simply unbox it, cut the plastic wrap, and the California King size mattress will expand to its original shape within 48-72 hours. And the mattress will fit for all kinds of bed frames, such as platform bed, box-spring, slatted bed, etc. The California King size mattress measures 84’’ x 72’’x 14’’.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zbjyhNxjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Airdown","source_asin":"B0BLB65RY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLB65RY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLB65RY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
