window.products.push({"id":750403,"name":"PEACE NEST 3-Piece Lightweight Quilt Set with Pillow Shams All Season Microfiber Bedspread Classic Diamond Pattern Coverlet, King Size, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nGlp1T0pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfy Fabric: The lightweight quilt has a quality microfiber cover and filled with 120gsm premium hollow siliconized fiber which brings you ultimate coziness throughout the night but also helps you immerse in undisturbed deep relaxation. The moderate thickness keeps you from feeling heavy or hot when you sleep and the fabric has a very smooth texture which providing serene moments in bed to any users Unique Design: The bed quilt has a classic diamond pattern on the facade which makes your room look more concise and elegant. Give you a different visual enjoyment no matter what style your room is decorated. The box-stitched keeps the filling from any sliding, clustering, and ensures the filling spread over the entire surface of the bedspread which makes the level of warmth and coziness is the same Multi-Purpose Usage: The coverlet set is the perfect option for changing seasons. It can provide a lighter cover option for the spring and summer while also add an extra layer of warmth in autumn and winter. Not to mention, quilts are a great way to add more style to your bed. Including 1 quilt (106\"X90\") and 2 pillow shams (20\"X36\"). 3-piece sets make your bed and the room more integrated and the soft sham texture gives you a more comfy sleep Care Instruction: Gentle machine wash in cold water and tumble dry with low heat to maintain maximum performance and recovery. The quilt will last for a long time if maintained properly Satisfactory Guarantee: We are thrilled to listen to your real thoughts and accordingly improve our products to ensure they are right what customers want and you will always find comfortable and preferable products here","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nGlp1T0pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peace nest","source_asin":"B08R7GPMHN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R7GPMHN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R7GPMHN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":750404,"name":"Towel Spa 75000 Jumbo Towel Warmer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sTfmq87fL._AC_SL1254_.jpg","description":"Our oversized Towel Spa warms up to two 40 x 70 bath sheets at a time, in less than 5 minutes, to give you a luxurious spa experience at home. Imagine stepping out of the bath or shower and into the cozy embrace of a heated towel. Great on cold days, a bathroom towel warmer starts your day right. Unlike wall-mounted radiant-water models, our freestanding heated Towel Spa can go where you go. Take it to any bathroom, your bedroom or by the front door. Auto-shut off ensures safety. 120 volts; 60Hz; 500 watts; UL listed; 73\" long power cord.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sTfmq87fL._AC_SL1254_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Towel Spa","source_asin":"B005HOOWB2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005HOOWB2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005HOOWB2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
