window.products.push({"id":750430,"name":"Homemate Heated Mattress Pad Queen Size for Cold Sleepers, 5 Heated Setting Coral Fleece Electric Mattress Pad Queen, Bed Warmer with Dual Controller ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y1mK5jN4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfortable sleep: Our heated mattress pad provide you with a warm and comfortable sleep, no longer have to be afraid of the cold in winter. The three-layer fabric can effectively resist static accumulation and electromagnetic radiation, allowing you to enjoy a perfect evening. At the same time, the heated mattress pad supports accelerated heating, so you hardly have to wait too long to lie comfortably under the covers. Soft fabric: Our electric mattress pad adopts soft coral fleece fabric, three layers of fabric and a more reasonable heating wire layout, which can evenly distribute heat and avoid local overheating; the normal maximum length of the skirt edge is 21 inches, which can achieve all-round package. Maximum safety: PTC/NTC heating wire is adopted, which has passed the UL964 safety standard, and the rated voltage is 110V. The heating mattress can promote blood circulation, relieve muscle soreness, let you completely relax after a hard day, and warm your cold hands and feet. Intelligent controller: dual controllers, you can let your partner choose their own exclusive temperature; 10 hours automatic power off, don't worry about forgetting to turn off the power, let you feel more at ease; 5 temperature gears, let you freely adjust your own temperature optimum temperature. The length of the power cord is 72+112 inch. Best Gift Choice: If you have a friend who is afraid of the cold, this is the best winter gift you can give him. The heated mattress supports hundreds of machine washes at the same time, as long as you unplug the power cord on the coupler, you can go straight to the wash. This is the best gift option as a bed warmer and the best safe option.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y1mK5jN4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeMate","source_asin":"B0BB7LNHX3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB7LNHX3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB7LNHX3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
