window.products.push({"id":750432,"name":"Soul Sisters Candle Gift for Women - Funny Candles, Birthday Gifts for Your Soul Sisters, Best Friends, Best Sister Ever Sister Gifts from Sister, Hig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o-tjEm4AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEST FRIEND SISTER GIFTS: Candle with gift box is the perfect Soul Sister candle and makes a funny gift for your soul sister or best friends.   Everyone will appreciate the humor and quality of this candle.  Carefully packaged in a gift box, it is an excellent present for your bff, work friend, sister, best friend, forever friend, bestie, true friend or sister.  Whether you have a new friend, old friend, longtime friend or long distance friend. Perfect gift for MANY OCCASIONS: Birthday Gift, Christmas Gift, Stocking Stuffers, 2021 Graduation Gift, Promotion, Retirement Gift, Going away gift, Mother's Day Gift, everyday Gift or a great décor item for your own home.   What a great way to show someone that you are thinking about them.    Gifting this candle is easy with the beautiful gift box that it comes packaged in. 100% All-Natural Soy Candle Hand Poured in Small Batches. Made in The USA.  10 Oz Scented Candle. Cotton With Paper Core Wick That Is Zinc And Lead Free. Candle Comes Packaged In A Gift Box, Ready To Give As A Fun Gift For Anyone Or For Yourself!  Great for any occasion - wonderful gifts for friends, family and Coworkers!  A perfect addition for any home.  Put it in your bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, living room office or foyer. All of our candles are made in small batches so that you always receive a perfect candle! We hand pour each and every candle in our home state of Minnesota with 100% soy wax infused with premium fragrance oils, free from any harmful chemicals or additives.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o-tjEm4AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CEDAR CRATE MARKET","source_asin":"B07MTN5HKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750432","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MTN5HKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MTN5HKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":750433,"name":"Dinghy Regatta/5 Hanging Mobile - 26 Inches Beech Wood - Handmade in Denmark by Flensted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-lhIvv5mL._AC_SL1215_.jpg","description":"How can I clean my mobile?Mobiles made of cardboard should only be dusted with a soft brush. Mobiles made of wood, aluminium or plastic can be wiped with a moist cloth with a few drops of mild dishwashing detergent.How long can my Mobile last?One person called us and said that they had inherited a Science Fiction Mobile from her grandmother who had had it for 30 years! In our home we have had the same mobile hanging for more than 20 years.Can my mobile hang outdoors?No. Since they are very sensitive to the simplest whiff of air hanging them outside is not recommendable.Will my mobile fade?In many of our mobiles we use plastic foil. This material is lightproof and easy to clean. Some other mobiles are made of cardboard. Even though we use the highest quality cardboard it will fade over the years. Red colors fade more than blue. You can delay fading by hanging the mobile out of direct sunlight.When hanging your mobile, try it in different places and bear in mind the following suggestions:1. The mobile is designed to be a pleasure to the eye and a stimulus to the imagination. Hang out of reach of children. It is not a toy.2. Hang it away from direct sunlight to avoid the colors fading and the shapes distorting.3. Hang it where there is some movement of air but no strong draft. A slow, quiet movement is the essence of the mobile. Do not hang it outdoors.4. Where practical, hang the mobile where it has a subdued, uniform background. A corner position against light-colored walls is often the best location.5. If possible, hang it in the light from a lamp. The shadow that the mobile casts onto a wall or ceiling will give the mobile yet another dimension. A candle is a concentrated light source which will produce distinct, well-defined shadows.6. Hang the mobile where you can watch it while listening to music. You will see the mobile move to the rhythm of the music.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-lhIvv5mL._AC_SL1215_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flensted Mobiles","source_asin":"B001ARZ6NS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750433","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001ARZ6NS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001ARZ6NS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":750434,"name":"Scratch Off Map of The World + United States Scratch Off Map - Includes Points of Interest - Premium Gift for The Travel Lovers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rMiCl+-nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Best Scratch Off Poster Maps for Travelers and Adventurers Oh, the places you’ll go! And now, you’ll remember them too! Designed for fun and education, The Travel the World Scratch Off Map Poster allows you to mark each country you have visited, revealing a beautifully colored country along with info like capitals, cities and more. The United States map features nice details and illustrations that show the path of the incredible 2017 solar eclipse. Create your very own personal travel story and display it for everyone to see. Plus, it’s 2 in 1, when you order you receive both World Scratch Map and United States Scratch Map as one set packed well in a tube .Discover all fifty states with your family, friends and loved ones. Each Scratch Map poster includes fun Challenge Boxes at the bottom that feature a special point of interest for certain countries and states. Plan a trip, reveal the challenge and go see something incredible! The maps feature: - Up to date map information from 2017  - Capitals, Cities  - USA map includes terrain and 2017 solar eclipse path  - Sturdy art paper  - Beautiful gloss coating  - Quality gold scratch foil layer  - Full color detailed maps beneath  - Challenge Boxes for ultimate adventurers Don’t just dream. Get started today by clicking “Add to Cart”…","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rMiCl+-nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Travel and Scratch","source_asin":"B075Q3QB4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075Q3QB4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075Q3QB4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
