window.products.push({"id":750456,"name":"Elite Home Jersey Knit 100% Cotton Sheet Set, Light Blue, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1St4B1aWoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What’s Included: Twin includes 66x96” sheet, fitted 39x75” sheet, & 1 pillowcase 20x30x4. Full includes flat 81x96x4\" sheet, fitted 54x75x12\" sheet, & 2 pillowcases 20x30”. Queen includes flat 90x102x4\" sheet, fitted 60x80x12\" sheet, & 2 pillowcases 20x30”. King includes flat 108x102x4\", fitted 78x80x12\", & 2 pillowcases 20x40”. California King includes 102x296”, fitted 72x84x12”, & 2 pillowcases 20x40\". The Material: Made from a high-quality, super soft, and durable 100% cotton jersey fabric. Choose from a variety of colors including: Light Blue, Dark Blue, Lilac, Light Grey, Dark Grey, and Tan. Easy to Put On: Our fitted sheets are fully elastic, making them easy for you to put on your mattress. Our sheets have deep pockets and are designed to fit all mattresses with a depth that does not exceed 12” inches. How to Wash: Our sheets are resistant to fading, staining, shrinking, and wrinkles! They are machine washable in cold water and dry quickly on tumble! Reliable & Consistent: EHP has forged a reputation for consistent quality, innovative design and reliability that enables the company to give our customers what they want. We are devoted to getting you affordable prices on the best products, made from responsibly sourced materials that do not sacrifice quality and comfort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1St4B1aWoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elite Home","source_asin":"B08NLGRZ5D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NLGRZ5D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NLGRZ5D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":750457,"name":"Wahdawn Aromatic Cedar Chips Closets Clothes Protector Drawer Freshener Natural Shoe Deodorizer Car Deodorant Organizer Storage Accessories (10 Pack)…","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s4lJTB2rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material and Effective: Fragrance Cedar Balls 100% made from original organic American Eastern Red Cedarwood for closets and drawers clothing protection and home air freshener. What is Eastern Red Cedar : Lumber taken from the eastern red cedar is a red, fragrant and strong wood. It frequently is used to make furniture, especially chests, dressers, lockers and similar pieces. The scent of eastern red cedar strong enough prevent from harmful elements that can damage the fabrics and render clothes unusable, making the cedar wood ideal for clothing storage. But the more popular western red cedar can't reach the effective, So Eastern Red Cedar is Your Better Choice Cedar Value Packing and Usage Instruction.10 Pack Cedar Wood Chips Sachets: Updated 2020 much biger and more fragrance than previous, idear for closets storage, drawers, amazon locker, dressers,cupboard, chests, underbed storage bins, shoes or cars. Long Lasting and Renewable Scent : Cedar fragrance lasting 4-6 months, refresh the cedar approx 6 months - 1 year (lasting time depend on the humidity and exposure to open air), just sand cedar surface lightly with sand paper or use cedar spray or essential oils,best effective used in enclosed space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s4lJTB2rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wahdawn","source_asin":"B089NZ7XZD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089NZ7XZD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089NZ7XZD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
