window.products.push({"id":750477,"name":"Peugeot Salma Corkscrew, Basalte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aVYOA1+BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Peugeot, a combination of design and ingenuity Since 1840, Peugeot Mills and products have been an essential benchmark for gourmets and great chefs alike. They are exceptional pieces that have become tableware icons, from coffee mills to salt, pepper, or spice grinders, manual or electric, and extended our expertise to produce corkscrews and a range of barware. Peugeot products are a pleasure to use with their sleek and elegant design, their noble indestructible materials, their range of shapes and colors, and their ever-more-innovative mechanisms, with a lifetime guarantee. A wide range of Peugeot Barware so you can get the best from each product All our products are instruments in taste designed with a single goal: to extract the most perfect experience, enjoyment and flavor possible, in the search for a delicious sensory experience. A journey through the world of the senses, an invitation to culinary excellence with a decidedly modern and contemporary approach, reflecting the perception of what is the French art of living today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aVYOA1+BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B004ZLW1T8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004ZLW1T8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004ZLW1T8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":750478,"name":"CDN Round Mechanical Timer, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QO5vwIzmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Old school meets new style with the new CDN easy-view Round Mechanical Timer (MTR). It stands out for the artistry of its modern look and for its easy-view functionality, with the time clearly visible on the top as well as the side. Featuring a stainless steel top and white, black, silver or red base, this mechanical timer offers all the ease of use of a traditional mechanical timer. There are no buttons to press, just a top to be turned. It's easy to set, easy to see and easy to hear the alarm when the set time is finished. With a diameter of 2.25 Inch, the Round Mechanical Timer (MTR) counts down by minute up to an hour and features a loud 3-second alarm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QO5vwIzmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CDN","source_asin":"B00N7FKA5U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N7FKA5U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N7FKA5U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
