window.products.push({"id":750552,"name":"Autumn Alley Farmhouse Door Mat - Hello Coir Doormat - Hello Doormat for Entryway/Front Door/Porch - Buffalo Check Hello Rug Script for Our Picket Fen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51K3429gaoS._AC_.jpg","description":"Welcome your guests in style with our farmhouse-style \"Hello\" door mat set, perfect for any front porch. Made of natural rubber and coir, these mats provide a durable and long-lasting cleaning solution for your home. The black rubber tray with wood grain mimics a picket fence, and the 3-D effect adds a touch of fun to your outdoor decor. With drainage holes, our coir inserts will keep your mat looking fresh and clean for years to come. Our sustainable Coconut Coir is easy to wash and vacuum, making it a convenient and eco-friendly choice. This set includes a buffalo check coir door mat, a fall coir door mat, and an autumn coir door mat, so you can switch up your front porch decor with ease. Add a touch of country charm to your outdoor space with this stylish set, and impress your guests with your welcoming spirit. It's the perfect gift for any housewarming party or for a stylish friend or family member looking to elevate their front porch decor. Get ready to say \"Hello\" to your new favorite front door mats!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51K3429gaoS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Autumn Alley","source_asin":"B08PSCWD3D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PSCWD3D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PSCWD3D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":750553,"name":"Cole & Mason H59408G Derwent Salt and Pepper Mills | Gourmet Precision+ | Stainless Steel/Acrylic | 190mm | Gift Set | Includes 2 x Salt and Pepper Gr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.07,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611avo0XLDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Cole & Mason Derwent mills are the perfect balance of stylishly contemporary and classically elegant. Made from crystal clear acrylic and stainless steel they make a beautiful addition to any home. The acrylic body ensures you can always view how filled the mills are. As part of the Cole & Mason Gourmet Precision range they provide you with the confidence to enhance the flavour of any meal through seasoning as a professional would. The Grind Select feature has pre-selected settings that have been tried and tested to ensure you always get the very best from your mills and the very best from your meals. The pepper mill has 6 settings whilst the salt mill has three, ranging from fine to coarse. Both mills come filled with premium quality whole black peppercorns from Vietnam and coarse sea salt from Belgium so you can start using from the moment you receive them. When you do need to refill, simply pull off the stainless steel top cap. The wide neck of the acrylic body makes refilling easy and mess free. Fill up with your favourite whole peppercorns and coarse salt, replace the top and continue to enjoy expertly seasoned dishes. All Cole & Mason mills are covered by the lifetime mechanism guarantee. The Gourmet Precision pepper mechanism is made from hardened carbon steel that strips instead of crushing peppercorns allowing them to release their natural oils which gives you more flavour with every turn whilst the salt mechanism is made from diamond-sharp ceramic. Salt should only be put in the salt mill as it will corrode the carbon steel of the pepper mill mechanism. Hints & tips: If your mill becomes difficult to grind, particularly on a fine setting, trying clearing the mechanism. Turn the mill upside down, loosen the knob to the coarsest setting and twist the top. This will free any large peppercorns or salt crystals that may have become lodged. Retighten the knob to the desired setting. Do not put salt in your pepper mill as this will corrode the carbon steel mechanism. At Cole & Mason we share your enthusiasm for a more adventurous range of seasoning and flavour enhancing products. We understand how new and exciting ingredients along with high quality kitchen tools and accessories can transform cooking and dining experiences. We have been designing and developing kitchenware from our head office in England since 1919. Awarded CoolBrands status for 2014/2015, we offer a well-established and intuitively designed range, with a product for every seasoning task from the kitchen to the table. Whether you need a manual or electronic mill, simple shakers, dry or fresh herb & spice products, pestle & mortar or an oil & vinegar pourer, all our products are manufactured with the highest quality materials and available in a wide range of finishes. Set Contains: 1 x Salt mill 1 x Salt mill 1 x Pepper mill 1 x Pepper mill 1 x Instruction leaflet 1 x Instruction leaflet","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611avo0XLDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cole & Mason","source_asin":"B01MZ644RD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MZ644RD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MZ644RD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
