window.products.push({"id":750673,"name":"YEARCHY Hanging Trash Can with Lid 2.4 Gallon Hanging Garbage Can for Counter Top or Under Sink Kitchen Cabinet Door Mounted Trash Can Bathroom Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qDX8PxL-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This trash can has a small volume but a large capacity. It can be widely use in kitchen ,bedroom ,bathroom or in your car.Say goodbye to trash fluids on your kitchen floors.Door hanging with over-the-door-hook ,wall-mounted with adhesive hooks.When you cook food, you don't need to open and close the door with wet hands to throw away the trash. Upgrade hanging kitchen trash can: ★ Two ways to open the lid ★ Two installation methods ★ Excellent sealing ★ Scraper  Package Included: 1x Trash can 1x Removable slide lid 1x Scraper 1x Hook 1x No trace adhesive Specifications: Material：High Density Polypropylene Size: 11.8*10.4*6.5 inches Volume: 2.4 gallon (9L) Note： 1. Please confirm the thickness of your cabinet door before purchasing(Less than 0.98in). 2. Adhesive installation: Clean the surface first, then press the adhesive hard to squeeze out the bubbles, wait 30 minutes before hanging the trash can(There will be no trace after tearing off). Please paste on a hard and smooth surface: glass, wood, metal, marble, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qDX8PxL-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YEARCHY","source_asin":"B08J2S2WDY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J2S2WDY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J2S2WDY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":750674,"name":"A Blush in The Fog Artwork by Lois Bryan, 16 by 20-Inch, White Matte with Black Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IWBDjnxXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features a snowy landscape. Lois Bryan describes herself as a 10-year old little kid, cleverly disguised as a 'woman of a certain age'. Ordinary, garden-variety, happily married photography an 11x14 giclee print under acrylic in a 16x20 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a black frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IWBDjnxXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00RNTM86A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RNTM86A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RNTM86A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
