window.products.push({"id":750765,"name":"Netzu Digital Alarm Clock, Alarm Clocks for Bedrooms with 8 Color Night Light, Large LED Display, Dual Alarm, Dimmer, USB Charger Port, Bedside Clock ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+cSVr6jcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Digital Alarm Clock with Night Light - When you wake up at night, just press the top of the alarm clock to find the light. Perfect for kids, they can chooses the color and then it lights up the room just enough that they're not scared. Upgrade Digital Clock with Large Display - The 7.5\" LED digital display helps you check the time clearly. The numbers are 2‘’ tall, you can see clearly even from a distance.We have upgraded the display, the number is clearer and display longer 0%-100% Full Range Brightness Dimmer - You can adjust the brightness to a comfortable level as needed. It can be adjusted to the brightest during the day for easy reading, also can be extremely dim during the night. We have upgrade the display, you can see it clear without hurting your eyes. Dual Alarm Clock & Snooze Function - Dual alarm allows you to set two different wake-up times to ensure you are never late for work. The alarm buzzer volume is adjustable. The snooze function can give you 9 extra minutes of sleep before alerting you again. Dual USB Charge Ports - Not just a night light alarm clock, the dual 5V 1A USB charging ports at the back of this digital alarm clock allow you to charge your iPhone, Android phones, and other smart devices at the same time. Easy to Setup & 12/24H Format It's easy to set the time, alarm and switch 12/24 hour display. Best Gifts for Kids and Seniors - The design of this alarm clock is compact and sleek, the warm night light makes it the best gift for kids, boys, girls and seniors. A Perfect room decor alarm clock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+cSVr6jcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Netzu","source_asin":"B09T2XV12B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T2XV12B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T2XV12B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":750766,"name":"Yogibo Puzzle Shaped Pillow for Kids, Fun, Cute, Decorative Throw Accent Cushion, Filled with Soft, Comfy FiBeads, Turquoise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810TnHA0wqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Yogibo Puzzle Pillow We made a fun throw pillow that will bring some creativity, imagination, and uniqueness to your living space. Novelty puzzle shaped pillows that can actually interlock, just like you would do with a real puzzle. Using the same innovativeness and signature comfort of our bean bags, we created a soft, cozy, and comfy throw pillow cushion which is decorative, and also a blast to play with. You can purchase multiple pillows to make a pillow puzzle and create a comfortable baby mat that would be perfect to use in a nursery or playroom. These cute throw pillows make fun toys for your child to get creative, while also making a fantastic decoration. Soft, Comfy, Fun and Playful The inside of this soft puzzle pillow is filled with near frictionless FiBeads that conforms to the contours of the body eliminating pressure points. Molding to comforting perfection, this pillow will feel amazing against your skin. We made these puzzle pillows in honor of the Sensory Community, which Yogibo is proud to be a part of. We donate part of the proceeds from every pillow sold to Kulture City, an organization that provides help and resources to special needs families. A Little About the Awesomeness of Yogibo Back in 2009, we set out on a mission to reinvent and breathe new life into the basic bean bag chair. To say consumers loved this fun, crazy concept would be an understatement! Fast forward to today, and we now carry a full line of creative, comfy furniture that loves you as much as you love it! Yogibo is seen all over the world in homes, schools, dorms, museums, and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810TnHA0wqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yogibo","source_asin":"B07FYRKX8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FYRKX8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FYRKX8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
