window.products.push({"id":750769,"name":"Privacy Window Films, Translucent Glass Tint Static Cling Treatment for Home Security and Decorative, Heat Control, UV Prevention - No Glue, No Residu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u8EGQhLsL._AC_SL1389_.jpg","description":"Art Mosaics Privacy Window Film has Magic 3D reflective effects, Provides Good Privacy, Protects Skin And Eyes, And Prevents Furniture From Fading And Aging By Blocking Out More Than 97% Harmful Rays And Filtering Strong Light. While Show You A Comfortable And Decorative Home Where Has no Disturbance From Dazzling Strong Light And UV Rays When You Are Enjoying The Natural Sunshine! High-performance Vinyl + Super static cling, lasting from 3 to 5 years. Tips: 1, Always put the film on the inside of window and only apply it to smooth glass surfaces. 2, Affix tape on a corner of the back side to quickly remove the clear backing. 3, For best results, do not apply film in direct sunlight or during freezing weather. 4, A helper is especially necessary when applying film to large windows. Having an extra hand will enable you to steady the film and work through issues if they arise. 5, Don't apply to the window frame. Cut off excessive edges after application if needed. Don't know how to use it? Don't worry, the static cling film is very easy to apply ! Step 1. Keep Window or Glass cleanStep 2. Wet the Window or Glass with water.( Soapy water will be better ) Step 3. Remove the Static Film from backing protect film, and then the smooth side should be post to the window. (Please MAKE SURE you have removed protect film before you apply the window film to glass) Step 4. When you install it, Apply to wet glass and smooth with hands. Step 5. Squeegee away water and air bubbles. Step 6. Much easier than Wall Decals, it's no problem for you. Step 7. Enjoy your works! GENUINE CUSTOMER SERVICE: Contact us anytime via Amazon for a free refund or replacement, no question asked, no return necessary! For any product related questions or concerns, just let us know and we'll endeavor to respond within 24hrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u8EGQhLsL._AC_SL1389_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jahoot","source_asin":"B07PDC3545","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PDC3545","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PDC3545","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
