window.products.push({"id":750776,"name":"Malicosmile Dream Catchers for Cars, Small Dream Catchers for Bedroom Wall Decor Car Ornament Rear View Mirror Hanging Accessories with Small Hanging ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512yGvJae5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Dream catcher was originated from the 18th century. Indians used it to capture the beautiful dreams and let the nightmares vanish with the appearance of the morning sunshine. They believed that the nights were filled with various dreams and only the dream catcher can filter the bad ones and bring them into sweet ones. 1. Product Information: ♥ Product Name: Tree of life small dream catchers ♥ Material: Feather + leather rope + crystal gravel + iron ring + copper wire; ♥ Size: About 15.7 inch (40 cm) in total length, 2.75 inch (7 cm) in circle diameter; ♥ Color: Brown red. 2. Product Features: ♥ The small mini dream catcher is handmade. Each one is unique in the world; ♥ The dreamcatcher adds elements of metal gadgets and tree of life. The style of the pendant is vintage and exquisite; ♥ The dream catcher feathers are fumigated and then carefully screened to ensure that each feather is flawless and trimmed by the master; ♥ Because of its beautiful design and symbols, the dream catcher is a great gift idea for both adults and kids. The dream catcher will make the space alive and bring more happy; 3. Product Application: ♥ The dream catcher is perfect for car rear view mirror decorations, the perfect size will not affect the driver's sight; ♥ The dreamcatcher is prefect for wall decor, bedroom or anywhere you want; ♥ It is a great festival holiday and birthday gift for your friends or families, with best wishes to them. 4. Note: The dream catchers are handmade, so it is normal if there are little differences between each one. 5. Service: If there is any question, please feel free to contact us. We will do our best for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512yGvJae5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Malicosmile","source_asin":"B09M9Y6FYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M9Y6FYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M9Y6FYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":750777,"name":"Sheffield Home, AMG and Enchante Accessories Coral Shell Curtain Rod 66 to 120-Inch, R1224 GLD, Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HLz5bZL8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Instantly upgrade your entire living area with these PREMIUM drapery rods by Sheffield Home. These curtain rods add more glamour to the interior of your space and give it an artistic touch. If you want to increase the elegance of a room, then you must choose the best curtain rod design which is suitable for your room's glory. But while choosing the design of a curtain rod, the artistic finish is not the only criteria. You must also consider the material and quality of the metal curtain rod. The rods must be durable and high quality so that they don't break or rust. Sheffield Home Window Treatment Drapery Rods are the best option for you to choose while shopping for adjustable metal curtain rods. The Coral Shell Drapery Rod in Soft Gold is made from premium quality materials. Its well-designed, sturdy structure adds to the decor and interior of any room. The rods will withstand wear and tear, and keep your room looking great for a long time. Ordinary drapery rods can falter with time, but Sheffield Home Window Treatment provides you with a quality product that lasts. Produced for and distributed by AMG Global, an Enchante Accessories company.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HLz5bZL8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sheffield Home","source_asin":"B06XDH8QWZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XDH8QWZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XDH8QWZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":750778,"name":"SunGrow Betta Glosso Seeds, Amphibious Carpet Plant, Mid and Foreground Tank Decor Provide Shelter and Security, Stress Reliever, Keep Fish Healthy, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fR+IochWL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Reconstructing Their Natural Habitat --- In the wild, betta lives in freshwater lakes, streams, and rivers. Their native habitat already has plenty of aquatic plants. By introducing the SunGrow’s Glosso plant into their environment, you will be providing them with home-like setting. This would make them more comfortable and active. You’ll likely see them more lively and energetic. Provide Protective Sanctuary For Betta & Fry --- Betta’s owing to their instinctive nature are territorial and can often turn aggressive. For this reason, this foreground cover would help in allotting a protection and hiding space for fry. Another Food Source! --- If you plant these glosso seeds, you may spot your bettas gorging over the leaves. This may come as a salvation, if at any time you forget to feed them owing to your busy routine. Most fish are omnivorous and plant intake can be done once in a while. This live plant aids in their digestion and promote a healthier ecosystem. For A Thriving Healthy Aquarium --- The live plant when grown serve as a unique filtration system. The leaves and the substrate has the ability to remove fish excreta resulting in a healthy environment. Additionally, plants promote breeding and egg laying. The bettas prefer to lay their eggs among the safety of plants. Aeration Of Water Column --- The 2 oz. pack of SunGrow Ground Cover Seeds when fully matured helps in oxygenating the water. This aeration is imperative for your fish virility, longevity, and survival. This live plant will also do away with the added expense of buying air pump and airstones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fR+IochWL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SunGrow","source_asin":"B07QNVQVGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750778","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QNVQVGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QNVQVGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
