window.products.push({"id":750875,"name":"Vonty Satin Sheets Extra Deep Pocket Queen Sheet Sets - Cooling & Silky Satin Queen Size Sheets with 18-24 Inch Deep Pocket, Grey Satin Bed Sheets Fit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dBL+EvISL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SILKY & SOFT BED SHEETS - Vonty Satin Sheets Set is made of high-quality satin material, which not only has a beautiful luster but is also incredibly soft to the touch. You will surprise at its silky, smooth and soft texture, sleeping on it is like laying on a cloud. Satin fabric (100% Polyester) can protect hair from breakage/knotting, help to reduce facial or neck wrinkle. No need to worry about messy hair or dry skin every day! EXTRA DEEP POCKET DESIGN - Vonty, an old brand that has a lot of research on satin fabrics, has launched a new extra deep pocket satin sheet set. Extra-deep pockets are designed for deeper mattresses, up to 24 inches deep. Not only that, but it's also great for shallow mattresses, as the deeper pockets wrap the mattress better and avoid slipping. The upgraded Extra deep pocket 24 inch satin bed sheet set will be your first choice. SWEET & ROMANTIC GIFTS - Soft and smooth satin deep pocket bed sheets helps to fall asleep quickly and enjoy peaceful sleeping every night. Silky Satin sheets set can be used all the year round - Keep cool in summer and keep warm in winter. Our high quality designs make the ultimate gift idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas. Best for any room in your house: bedroom, guest, kids room, vacation home. EASY TO CARE - Satin bed sheet set Machine wash separately in cold water on gentle cycle, tumble dry low, do not bleach. Please be careful for scratching the extra deep pocket sheets (you can also use a laundry bag). Satin deep pocket sheet is more sturdy, durable and inexpensive than silk sheets which need professional cares. If your skin is sensitive, we suggest you to wash it before using. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE - Vonty bed sheets are some of the softest and affordable satin sheets you can find online, they are backed by incredible customer service to make sure your satisfaction is guaranteed. If you don't like our sheets, you can return them within 30 days of Amazon's guidelines for a refund or replacement, no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dBL+EvISL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vonty","source_asin":"B0BDDJM9RW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-750875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDDJM9RW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDDJM9RW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
